# Gemini ecosystem entry points and session-critical endpoints.
#
# The exact hosts in the first section are published by Google Workspace Help:
# https://knowledge.workspace.google.com/admin/generative-ai/gemini-app/gemini-app-firewall-settings
# Source page last updated 2026-07-22 and licensed under CC BY 4.0.
#
# Exact hosts are intentional. Do not replace them with broad google.com,
# googleapis.com, googleusercontent.com, or gstatic.com suffixes because those
# suffixes would also capture Drive and unrelated high-volume Google traffic.

